[en.FOCUS_C18_110_SECRET_CENTAUR]
Secret to Centaurs

[en.FOCUS_C18_110_SECRET_CENTAUR_desc]
Until now, the centaurs still don’t know about our existence, at least for Tirek, it’s better to keep this secret.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_SECRET_CENTAUR]
对半人马的保密

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_SECRET_CENTAUR_desc]
直到现在，半人马，至少是提雷克，还不知道我们的存在，最好，我们要将这个秘密保持下去。

